8. Installation

Install the required dependencies using:

    py -m pip install -r requirements.txt

 9. How to Run the Project

Run the main program:

    py main.py

Run the processor benchmark:

    py src/benchmark.py

Open Main.ipynb in Visual Studio Code to view the
implementation, results, and visualizations.

10. Important Notes

Processor A and Processor B currently use illustrative
coupling topologies for routing experiments. Their
configurations have not been verified as official processor
specifications.

The current results represent local simulation and circuit
transpilation, not execution on physical quantum hardware.

Benchmark conclusions should be interpreted in the context
of the selected illustrative topologies.

